#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:48
#, no-c-format
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Uvod"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:50
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kdiamond; is a single player puzzle game."
msgstr "&kdiamond; je puzzle igra za jednog igrača."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:54
#, no-c-format
msgid "The object of the game is to build lines of three similar diamonds."
msgstr "Poenta igre je složiti tri ista dijamanta u niz."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:60
#, no-c-format
msgid "How to Play"
msgstr "Kako igrati"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:62
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The player is presented with a rectangular grid containing several types of "
"diamonds. The object of the game is to swap neighbored diamonds to assemble "
"a line of three similar diamonds. These lines will vanish and the board will "
"be refilled with new diamonds. The game time is limited, try to build as "
"much lines as possible to earn a high score."
msgstr ""
"Igrač se susreće sa pravouglom pločom na kojoj se nalazi nekoliko vrsta "
"dijamanata.  Poenta igre je zamijeniti dva susjedna dijamanta kako biste "
"sastavili niz od tri ista dijamanta. Ta linija će nestati, a ploča će biti "
"dopunjena novim dijamantima. Vrijeme igre je ograničeno, pokušajte spojiti "
"što više nizova kako biste oborili rekord."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:66
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Click on one diamond, then on one of its neighbors. The diamonds will then "
"be swapped. (You may also click and drag a diamond upon one of its neighbors "
"to invoke the swap.) If no line of at least three diamonds is formed by the "
"swap, it will be reverted. The status bar displays the game time left, the "
"number of points you have earned, and the number of possible moves."
msgstr ""
"Kiknite dijamant, a zatim jedan od njegovih susjeda. Tako će dijamanti "
"zamijeniti mjesta. (Također možete kliknuti dijamant i povući ga prema "
"njegovom susjedu kako biste prouzrokovali zamjenu.) Ukoliko prilikom zamjene "
"nije formiran niz od najmanje tri dijamanta dijamanti će se vratiti na "
"prvobitne pozicije."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:73
#, no-c-format
msgid "Game Rules, Strategies and Tips"
msgstr "Pravila Igre, Strategije i Savjeti"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:76
#, no-c-format
msgid "Rules"
msgstr "Pravila"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:78
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When a line was removed and the diamonds fall down to fill gaps, it may be "
"that then new lines are composed. Try to achieve such cascades when "
"selecting a diamond pair as you will earn extra points: You get 1 point for "
"the line you build, 2 points for the first cascade, 3 points for a possible "
"next cascade, and so on."
msgstr ""
"Kada je niz uklonjen i novi dijamanti popune ploču, moguće je da se "
"formiraju novi nizovi. Pokušajte postići sto više ovakvih kaskada kada "
"birate par dijamanata kako biste zaradili dodatne bodove: Dobijate 1 bod za "
"niz koji napravite, 2 boda za prvu kaskadu, 3 za narednu itd."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:79
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Try to build lines with more than 3 diamonds: You will earn an extra second "
"for each two extra diamonds removed."
msgstr ""
"Pokušajte sastaviti nizove sa više od tri dijamanta: Zaradit ćete dodatnu "
"sekundu za svaka dodatna dva dijamanta koja uklonite."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:80
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The number of diamond types increases when choosing <guilabel>Hard</"
"guilabel> difficulty levels, thus making it harder to build lines. In "
"contrast, the board size will grow on the <guilabel>Easy</guilabel> "
"difficulty levels to make it easier to find a move."
msgstr ""
"Broj vrsta dijamanata raste kada odaberete <guilabel>Hard</guilabel> nivo "
"težine, što otežava sastavljanje nizova. Nasuprot tome, veličina ploče će "
"rasti pri odabiru <guilabel>Easy</guilabel> nivoa težine kako bi vam bilo "
"lakše pronaći potez."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:81
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The game will stop once there are no possible moves left. Especially on "
"<guilabel>Hard</guilabel> difficulty levels, you should keep this in mind "
"when choosing your next move."
msgstr ""
"Igra se prekida kada više nema mogućih poteza. Naročito na <guilabel>Hard</"
"guilabel> nivoima težine, trebate obratiti pažnju na ovo prilikom odabira "
"narednog poteza."

