#: index.docbook:169
#, no-c-format
msgid "Lets you set the difficulty level from a sub-menu."
msgstr "Omogućava vam da podesite nivo težine iz podizbornika."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:170
#, no-c-format
msgid "There are five levels of difficulty:"
msgstr "Postoji pet nivoa težine:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:172
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>Very easy</guimenuitem>: 12 rows, 12 columns, 5 types of "
"diamonds."
msgstr ""
"<guimenuitem>Veoma lako</guimenuitem>: 12 redova, 12 kolona, 5 vrsta "
"dijamanata."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:173
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>Easy</guimenuitem>: 10 rows, 10 columns, 5 types of diamonds."
msgstr ""
"<guimenuitem>Lako</guimenuitem>: 10 redova, 10 kolona, 5 vrsta dijamanata."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:174
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>Medium</guimenuitem>: 8 rows, 8 columns, 5 types of diamonds."
msgstr ""
"<guimenuitem>Srednje</guimenuitem>: 8 redova, 8 kolona, 5 vrsta dijamanata."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:175
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>Hard</guimenuitem>: 8 rows, 8 columns, 6 types of diamonds."
msgstr ""
"<guimenuitem>Teško</guimenuitem>: 8 redova, 8 kolona, 6 vrsta dijamanata."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:176
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>Very hard</guimenuitem>: 8 rows, 8 columns, 7 types of diamonds."
msgstr ""
"<guimenuitem>Veoma teško</guimenuitem>: 8 redova, 8 kolona, 7 vrsta "
"dijamanata."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:182
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guimenu>Settings</guimenu><guimenuitem>Configure Notifications...</"
"guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<guimenu>Postavke</guimenu><guimenuitem>Postavka obavještenja...</"
"guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:184
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This item displays a standard &kde; notifications configuration dialog, "
"where you can change the notifications (sounds, visible messages, &etc;) "
"used by &kdiamond;."
msgstr ""
"Ova stavka prikazuje uobičajni &kde; dijalog za postavku obavještenja, gdje "
"možete promijeniti obavještenja (zvuk, prikaz poruka, &etc;) koristi "
"&kdiamond;."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:190
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guimenu>Settings</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Configure &kdiamond;...</"
"guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<guimenu>Postavke</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Postavka &kdiamond;...</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:194
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Choose a graphical theme for the game. Which themes are available depends on "
"the current installation. You may also download new themes which have been "
"created by third-party designers."
msgstr ""
"Odaberite grafičku temu igre. Koje su teme dostupne ovisi od instalacije. "
"Također možete skinuti nove teme koje su kreirala treća lica."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:199
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Additionally &kappname; has the common &kde; <guimenu>Settings</guimenu> and "
"<guimenu>Help</guimenu> menu items, for more information read the sections "
"about the <ulink url=\"help:/fundamentals/ui.html#menus-settings\">Settings "
"Menu</ulink> and <ulink url=\"help:/fundamentals/ui.html#menus-help\">Help "
"Menu</ulink> of the &kde; Fundamentals."
msgstr ""
"Dodatno &kappname; ima zajedničke &kde; <guimenu>Postavke</guimenu> i "
"<guimenu>Pomoć</guimenu> stavke izbornika, za više informacija pročitajte "
"sekcije o <ulink url=\"help:/fundamentals/ui.html#menus-settings\">Izbornik "
"postavki</ulink> i <ulink url=\"help:/fundamentals/ui.html#menus-help"
"\">Izbornik pomoći</ulink> od &kde; Osnove."

